									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Cranked is the dream project of a small team of riders and developers, including members of the original crew behind Mad Skills Motocross and Mad Skills BMX. It’s a downhill mountain bike game built to capture what it really feels like to ride—the speed, the flow, and the satisfaction of control—paired with the obsessive pursuit of the perfect run. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >What Makes Cranked Different </h2><h2 class="bb_tag" >Fun-First Design</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every choice is guided by a single question: does it make the game more fun? We're going back to old-school game design where our priority is the player experience. No microtransactions. No exploitative hooks.  Just pure MTB fun. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/e3afd90c59b2fc852cb993a639fb1dce.poster.avif?t=1792863088" width=616 height=206 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/e3afd90c59b2fc852cb993a639fb1dce.webm?t=1792863088" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/e3afd90c59b2fc852cb993a639fb1dce.mp4?t=1792863088" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" > </p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Responsive Control</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >The “free-whip” system gives you full command of bike handling and style, with no canned animations getting in the way. Cranked has a heavy focus on technical riding, line choice, and capturing the essence of real-world trails. </p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/cac15661d55b504f7b5c941077e19057.poster.avif?t=1792863088" width=616 height=206 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/cac15661d55b504f7b5c941077e19057.webm?t=1792863088" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/cac15661d55b504f7b5c941077e19057.mp4?t=1792863088" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Global Racing Competition</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Push yourself against players worldwide on constantly updated leaderboards, with instant restarts that fuel mastery and the hunt for that perfect run.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/0e78d650b5b0c86e6fb46c6f6a6822b6.poster.avif?t=1792863088" width=616 height=206 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/0e78d650b5b0c86e6fb46c6f6a6822b6.webm?t=1792863088" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/0e78d650b5b0c86e6fb46c6f6a6822b6.mp4?t=1792863088" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Open-Mountain Freedom</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Explore a vast landscape of trails, hidden paths, shortcuts, and easter eggs at your own pace.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/900838e9d2dc6c6e60137aa46f8fd158.poster.avif?t=1792863088" width=616 height=206 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/900838e9d2dc6c6e60137aa46f8fd158.webm?t=1792863088" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/900838e9d2dc6c6e60137aa46f8fd158.mp4?t=1792863088" type="video/mp4"></video></span>  </p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Modding as a Pillar</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Modding isn’t an extra feature; it’s a non-negotiable pillar of Cranked’s design.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/3bfda8f5e37e8e054ede1249172c557f.poster.avif?t=1792863088" width=616 height=206 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/3bfda8f5e37e8e054ede1249172c557f.webm?t=1792863088" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989790/extras/3bfda8f5e37e8e054ede1249172c557f.mp4?t=1792863088" type="video/mp4"></video></span> </p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
